      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Model Building and Evaluation\n",
        "\n",
        "**Objective:**\n",
        "* Implement deep learning models using TensorFlow/Keras.\n",
        "* Construct traditional machine learning models (Decision Tree, K-Means).\n",
        "* Evaluate model performance using advanced metrics and visualization techniques (Confusion Matrix Heatmaps)."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "oD7Y-8EJ1hz6"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "9lV2JovI1cyQ",
        "outputId": "ae553bc6-1f92-4802-84ce-9e137de2c49e"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
