    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 2. Decision Tree Classification\n",
        "**Technique:** DecisionTreeClassifier (Scikit-Learn)\n",
        "**Evaluation:** Accuracy, Classification Report"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xJBuBQXN2PAJ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Data Preparation\n",
        "Load the Iris dataset for multi-class classification."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "HHNXf8Pv2SC9"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Load multi-class dataset\n",
        "iris_data = datasets.load_iris()\n",
        "X_dt = iris_data.data\n",
        "y_dt = iris_data.target\n",
        "\n",
        "# Split the dataset\n",
        "X_train_dt, X_test_dt, y_train_dt, y_test_dt = train_test_split(\n",
        "    X_dt, y_dt, test_size=0.2, random_state=42\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Iris data loaded. Training samples: {len(X_train_dt)}\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "rJtPE-AO2To1",
        "outputId": "60f8d2b5-a6e7-4e93-e5ab-05391bcf6539"
      },
      "execution_count": 6,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Iris data loaded. Training samples: 120\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Model Training\n",
        "Initialize and train the Decision Tree without deep pruning for baseline performance."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OCDGYXAU2VsA"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Initialize and fit the Decision Tree model\n",
        "dt_model = DecisionTreeClassifier(random_state=42)\n",
        "dt_model.fit(X_train_dt, y_train_dt)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Decision Tree model trained successfully.\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "5RWdtmNo2XV3",
        "outputId": "5057727b-775d-4aef-907b-50a97cc92a4c"
      },
      "execution_count": 7,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Decision Tree model trained successfully.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Evaluation and Visualization\n",
        "Evaluate the Decision Tree against the test set and display the metric reports."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "MKdDVgGr2byl"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Predict using the test set\n",
        "y_pred_dt = dt_model.predict(X_test_dt)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Evaluate metrics\n",
        "accuracy_dt = accuracy_score(y_test_dt, y_pred_dt)\n",
