    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 3. K-Means Clustering\n",
        "**Technique:** K-Means (Unsupervised Learning)\n",
        "**Evaluation:** Cluster Centroids, Silhouette Score"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "9TEOO4ci2hIk"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Data Preparation\n",
        "Load the Wine dataset and remove the target labels to simulate an unsupervised learning scenario. Apply standard scaling."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zlDSH7QE2ic-"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Load Wine dataset\n",
        "wine_data = datasets.load_wine()\n",
        "X_km_raw = wine_data.data\n",
        "\n",
        "# Standardize features to balance distance calculations\n",
        "scaler_km = StandardScaler()\n",
        "X_km_scaled = scaler_km.fit_transform(X_km_raw)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Unsupervised data prepared and scaled. Shape: {X_km_scaled.shape}\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "Qs-KFVKG2kRM",
        "outputId": "4107769d-756a-4d03-a669-967ba9822b4e"
      },
      "execution_count": 9,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Unsupervised data prepared and scaled. Shape: (178, 13)\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: Model Training\n",
        "Initialize K-Means with an assumed 3 clusters based on prior exploratory data analysis."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "w8KnXVj62mJ8"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Initialize and fit K-Means model\n",
        "kmeans_model = KMeans(n_clusters=3, random_state=42, n_init=10)\n",
        "cluster_labels = kmeans_model.fit_predict(X_km_scaled)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Extract centroids\n",
        "centroids = kmeans_model.cluster_centers_\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"K-Means clustering completed.\")"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "iBGH0YcN2niu",
        "outputId": "6a51e244-b816-4f82-b5b0-6b9bced545d9"
      },
      "execution_count": 10,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "K-Means clustering completed.\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: Evaluation and Visualization\n",
        "Calculate the internal validation metric (Silhouette Score) and plot the cluster distribution on a 2D plane using the first two principal features."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "R2NkRTdZ2pRW"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Calculate internal clustering metric\n",
        "sil_score = silhouette_score(X_km_scaled, cluster_labels)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"--- K-Means Evaluation ---\")\n",
        "print(f\"Silhouette Score: {sil_score:.4f}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# Visualize the clusters using the first two features (Alcohol vs. Malic Acid)\n",
        "plt.figure(figsize=(7, 5))\n",
        "scatter = plt.scatter(X_km_scaled[:, 0], X_km_scaled[:, 1], c=cluster_labels, cmap='viridis', alpha=0.7)\n",
        "plt.scatter(centroids[:, 0], centroids[:, 1], c='red', marker='X', s=150, label='Centroids')\n",
        "\n",
        "plt.xlabel('Feature 1 (Standardized)')\n",
        "plt.ylabel('Feature 2 (Standardized)')\n",
        "plt.title('K-Means Cluster Distribution')\n",
        "plt.legend()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
